  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 548.08 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before the medicaid program is billed, in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #5578, eff 2-11-93; ss by #6939, Interim, eff. 1-30-99, EXPIRED 5-30-99\n\nNew. #7036, eff 6-25-99; ss by #8904, eff 6-25-07; ss by #10914, eff 8-26-15",
